class_name GameHelp
extends RefCounted


static func get_text() -> String:
	return """Red Soul is imprisoned within The Void, where the Land is the sole surviving boundary preventing Red Soul from being swallowed into the abyss. An invading army of Black Souls arrives, causing fragments of the Land to be destroyed and plummet into the void. Red Soul must fight to the end, collecting energy particles to continuously regenerate their land and free themselves from the shackles of The Void.

CONTROLS
WASD / Arrows — move
Mouse — aim
Left click — shoot
Right click — laser beam
Tab — main menu
ESC — this help

DUST
Collect two energy particles to fill the gauge — then the Land restores several tiles at once.

ENEMIES
Minions — rush the Land in numbers.
Medium Black Souls — armored and shoot back.
The Black Soul — warlord of the invasion."""
